Google Chrome that displays the website has to be started with, otherwise the movie won't be played.

chrome.exe --autoplay-policy=no-user-gesture-required

So for example in /etc/xdg/openbox/autostart you need the following line to start chromium in kiosk mode:

chromium-browser --disable-infobars --kiosk --autoplay-policy=no-user-gesture-required "/var/lib/outposts/comm.html"




Wird verwendet in folgenden Raspis:

abandoned_dock_comm_1:
LEDS = 184

abandoned_crew_comm:
LEDS = 171

abandoned_tech_comm_1:
LEDS = 151

abandoned_tech_comm_2:
LEDS = 121